  "How to manage and create plugins — namespaced bundles of skills, agents, rules, MCP servers and hooks that install, enable and disable as a single unit. Use this skill when the user wants to enable, disable, install or uninstall a plugin, when they want to create a new plugin, or when a new customization should be packaged into a plugin rather than left loose. Also triggered by the /plugin slash command. Don't use for the underlying customization system itself — discovery roots, loading priority, or authoring a standalone skill, agent, rule, hook or MCP server outside a plugin; see the customizations guide skill for those.": "如何管理与创建插件（将技能、智能体、规则、MCP 服务器与钩子打包为一个可整体安装、启用与禁用的命名空间套件）。当用户需要启用、禁用、安装、卸载或新建插件时使用，也可通过 /plugin 命令触发。",
  "How to render rich interactive HTML widgets inline in the chat or as standalone artifacts. Use this skill when you want to show the user diagrams, data visualizations, interactive controls, educational walkthroughs, or any rich visual content beyond plain text and markdown.": "如何在对话内嵌或作为独立工件渲染富交互 HTML 小组件。适合向用户展示图表、数据可视化、交互控件、教学演练等超越纯文本和 Markdown 的视觉内容。",
  "How to write and run a dynamic workflow script with the `run_workflow` tool: a Python script that orchestrates many agents with `agent`, `parallel`, `pipeline`, and `phase`. Use when a task splits into many independent or staged pieces of agent work (fan out over files, modules, bugs, or review angles, then aggregate), or when the user asks for a workflow. Don't use for a single delegated task (use a subagent) or for legacy workflow files (see migrate-workflows).": "如何使用 `run_workflow` 工具编写和运行动态工作流脚本：通过 `agent`、`parallel`、`pipeline` 和 `phase` 编排多个智能体的 Python 脚本。适用于多文件扇出、分阶段流水线等需要多个智能体协同聚合的任务。",
