  "The agent made no code changes, but other files may still be affected if your workspace changed for other reasons (e.g. a sync) in the meantime.": "智能体未修改任何代码，但如果您的工作区在此期间因其他原因（如同步操作）发生变化，其他文件仍可能受到影响。",
  "The agent never asks for confirmation before executing terminal commands (except those in the Deny list). This provides the agent with the maximum ability to operate over long periods without intervention, but also has the highest risk of the agent executing an unsafe terminal command.": "智能体在执行终端命令前绝不会请求确认（拒绝列表中的命令除外）。这使智能体能够最顺畅地长时间自主运行而无需人工干预，但同时也伴随执行不安全终端命令的最高风险。",
  "The agent was prevented from accessing some sites": "已阻止智能体访问某些网站",
  "The agent will wait for you to install the browser extension.": "智能体将等待您安装浏览器扩展程序。",
  "The agent works with autonomy-enhancing features and does not ask questions or request new permissions.": "智能体以自主增强特性运行，不主动提问或申请新权限。",
