  "The breakdown below shows token usage from customizations like skills, rules, and MCP. If the budget is exceeded, large customizations will be truncated automatically.": "下方详细展示了来自技能（Skills）、规则（Rules）和 MCP 等自定义配置的 Token 消耗情况。如果超出预算，大型自定义项将自动截断。",
